 "statement": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "Each log is \"<userId> <action> <timestamp>\" with action signin or signout; logs are in non-decreasing timestamp order. Per user, a signin opens a session (a signin while a session is open replaces its start time); a signout closes the open session and is ignored when none is open. A closed session is valid when signout time - signin time <= maxTime. Return the users with at least one valid session, sorted in code-point order.",
  "provenance": [
